Package: HyBsNet
Title: Reusable DEG Similarity Network Analysis and Visualization
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("HyBs", "Analysis Team", email = "noreply@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides deterministic and reusable tools for building, analysing,
    laying out, plotting, and exporting differential-expression similarity
    networks. The package separates scientific parameters from visual styling
    so that figure appearance can be revised without silently changing network
    topology or statistical thresholds.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/maxbond233/HyBsNet
BugReports: https://github.com/maxbond233/HyBsNet/issues
